        "type": "p",
        "text": "Inflation is one of the highest-weight topics in O Level Economics (CAIE 2281 and Edexcel). It appears in Paper 1 (multiple choice), Paper 2 (structured questions), and is essential background for understanding government policy, unemployment, and international trade."
